LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자(학사경고 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 수학기간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 대구대 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 12. 26.(목)~ 2014. 1. 16.(목)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청학점 및 등록금 : 2과목 6학점 이내 / 학점당 금액은 첨부파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청서 제출 장소 : 